WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The traveler found an unsigned map inside the station locker and checked every mark against the town archive.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The route did not lead to treasure. It connected three families who had lost contact after the old bridge closed.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:59.000
By sunset they met beside the repaired bridge, compared their letters, and agreed to preserve the map as a public record.
